# What is a palindrome?

=== layout: two-panels

# Literary Palindromes

@left

- A palindrome is a word, phrase, number, or other sequence of characters which reads the same backward or forward.

@right

![Slide image 1](assets/lect02e-restriction_enzymes/image_001.png)
![Slide image 2](assets/lect02e-restriction_enzymes/image_002.png)

=== layout: title-content

# Literary Palindromes

@body

- Madam
- Race car
- Never odd or Even
- Go Hang a Salami I’m a lasagna hog
- Literary Palindromes are same both forwards and backwards

