# Palindrome DNA Sequences

=== layout: title-content

# Genetic Palindromes

@body

- A palindromic sequence is one where the 5&prime; to 3&prime; sequence is identical on both strands of a double strand polynucleotide
- 5&prime;-`AGTACT`-3&prime;

