# Restriction Enzyme: PstI

@body

- `CTGCA|G`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`CTGCA|G`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`G|ACGTC`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?
- PstI

=== layout: title-content

# Restriction Enzyme: PstI

@body

- `CTGCA|G`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`CTGCA|G`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`G|ACGTC`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?
  - 5&prime;-`CTGCA`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-G
- What is the overhang?
- PstI

=== layout: title-content

# Restriction Enzyme: PstI

@body

- `CTGCA|G`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`CTGCA|G`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`G|ACGTC`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?
  - 5&prime;-`CTGCA`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-G
- What is the overhang?
  - 3&prime; overhang (the 3&prime; is all alone at the end)
  - 5&prime;-`TGCA`-3&prime; or 3&prime;-`ACGT`-5&prime;
- PstI

